hics systems for DEC Alpha with TURBOchannel. These are external boxes simil=
ar in size to a VAXstation 4000 that connect to a TURBOchannel interface car=
d for hardware-accelerated 3D. They=E2=80=99re new-in-box and include all th=
e necessary interfaces, cabling, manuals, and I believe software as well. (T=
hough I think the drivers are also included by DEC in the supported operatin=
g systems.)

I got one for my collection from them for a very good price, and the seller s=
till has one more=E2=80=94and may want the space back, since they messaged m=
e asking if I wanted to buy the other one too at the same price=E2=80=94so t=
hey will probably be willing to give a great deal to someone who wants it. S=
ay if they wanted to try their hand at creating a driver for it for an OS li=
ke BSD=E2=80=A6

